---
import HtmlLayout2026 from '../layouts/HtmlLayout2026.astro';
---

<HtmlLayout2026
  title="Founding & Scaling the AI Platform Design Organization | Tami McBride"
    description="How I built and scaled ServiceNow's AI Platform Design organization from 15 to 62 people while maintaining 88% engagement and powering 200M+ AI assists."
  
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
        <style is:global>
        
        :root {
            --bg-primary: #FEFEFE;
            --bg-secondary: #F8F9FA;
            --bg-card: #FFFFFF;
            --text-primary: #1A1A1A;
            --text-secondary: #6B7280;
            --text-tertiary: #9CA3AF;
            --accent-gradient-start: #6366F1;
            --accent-gradient-end: #EC4899;
            --accent-primary: #6366F1;
            --accent-teal: #14B8A6;
            --accent-cyan: #06B6D4;
            --accent-warm: #F59E0B;
            --border-subtle: #E5E7EB;
            --border-card: #E5E7EB;
            --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
            --shadow-md: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            --shadow-lg: 0 12px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
            --font-serif: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
            --font-sans: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
        }
        
        [data-theme="dark"] {
            --bg-primary: #0A0B0D;
            --bg-secondary: #131417;
            --bg-card: #1A1B1F;
            --text-primary: #F9FAFB;
            --text-secondary: #D1D5DB;
            --text-tertiary: #6B7280;
            --accent-gradient-start: #818CF8;
            --accent-gradient-end: #F472B6;
            --accent-primary: #818CF8;
            --accent-teal: #14B8A6;
            --accent-cyan: #22D3EE;
            --border-subtle: #1F2937;
            --border-card: #2D3340;
        }
        
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        img,
        svg,
        video,
        canvas {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
        }

        p,
        a,
        li,
        blockquote {
            overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        }
        
        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: var(--font-sans);
            background: var(--bg-primary);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            line-height: 1.7;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            transition: background-color 0.4s ease;
        }
        
        h1, h2, h3, h4 {
            font-family: var(--font-serif);
            line-height: 1.2;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }
        
        h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
            font-weight: 400;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        h2 {
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
            font-weight: 400;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        
        h3 {
            font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        h4 {
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            color: var(--accent-primary);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        p {
            font-size: 1.0625rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        
        strong {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }
        
        a {
            color: var(--accent-primary);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.2s ease;
        }
        
        a:hover {
            color: var(--accent-teal);
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 3rem;
        }
        
        .narrow {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        
        /* Header */
        .header {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            padding: 1.5rem 0;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        
        .header-content {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .back-link {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }
        
        .theme-toggle {
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            padding: 0.625rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        
        .theme-toggle:hover {
            background: var(--accent-primary);
            color: white;
            border-color: var(--accent-primary);
        }
        
        /* Hero */
        .case-hero {
            padding: 6rem 0 4rem;
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        }
        
        .case-hero h1 {
            max-width: 900px;
        }
        
        .case-subtitle {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--text-tertiary);
            font-style: italic;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            max-width: 700px;
        }
        
        .case-meta {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .meta-item {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.25rem;
        }
        
        .meta-label {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            color: var(--text-tertiary);
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        
        .meta-value {
            font-size: 1.125rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }
        
        .impact-badges {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        
        .impact-badge {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-teal), var(--accent-cyan));
            color: white;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1.125rem;
        }
        
        /* Content Sections */
        .content {
            padding: 4rem 0;
        }
        
        .section {
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
        }
        
        .section-content {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
            border-radius: 1.25rem;
            padding: 3rem;
        }
        
        /* Images */
        .images-section {
            margin: 4rem 0;
        }
        
        .images-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 2rem;
        }
        
        .image-full {
            grid-column: span 2;
        }
        
        .image-wrapper {
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .image-wrapper img {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 1rem;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }
        
        .image-caption {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: var(--text-tertiary);
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }
        
        /* Growth Viz */
        .growth-viz {
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border-radius: 1.25rem;
            padding: 3rem;
            margin: 3rem 0;
        }
        
        .viz-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        .viz-badge {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-teal), var(--accent-cyan));
            color: white;
            padding: 0.375rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 1rem;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        
        .phases-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 2rem;
            margin: 3rem 0;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .growth-arrow {
            position: absolute;
            top: 6rem;
            left: 2rem;
            right: 2rem;
            height: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-teal), var(--accent-cyan));
            opacity: 0.4;
        }
        
        .growth-arrow::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            right: -8px;
            top: -4px;
            width: 0;
            height: 0;
            border-left: 8px solid var(--accent-cyan);
            border-top: 5px solid transparent;
            border-bottom: 5px solid transparent;
        }
        
        .phase {
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        .phase-number {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-teal), var(--accent-cyan));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        .phase-label {
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
        }
        
        .phase-date {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-tertiary);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .dots-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 12px);
            gap: 6px;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        
        .dot {
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-teal), var(--accent-cyan));
        }
        
        .viz-divider {
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            margin: 3rem 0;
        }
        
        .stats-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 2rem;
        }
        
        .stat {
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .stat-value {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent-teal);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        .stat-label {
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        
        /* Outcomes */
        .outcomes-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }
        
        .outcome-card {
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 1rem;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-teal);
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .outcome-value {
            font-family: var(--font-serif);
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-teal), var(--accent-cyan));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        
        .outcome-label {
            font-size: 0.9375rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        
        /* Callout */
        .callout {
            background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-warm);
            padding: 2rem 2.5rem;
            border-radius: 0 1rem 1rem 0;
            margin: 3rem 0;
        }
        
        .callout h4 {
            color: var(--accent-warm);
        }
        
        .callout p {
            margin: 0;
        }
        
        /* Navigation */
        .case-nav {
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            padding: 3rem 0;
            margin-top: 4rem;
        }
        
        .case-nav-content {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 2rem;
        }
        
        .nav-link {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
            border-radius: 0.75rem;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        
        .nav-link:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent-primary);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }
        
        .nav-label {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            color: var(--text-tertiary);
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        
        .nav-title {
            font-size: 1.125rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }
        
        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 968px) {
            .phases-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
            
            .images-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            
            .outcomes-grid,
            .stats-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .container {
                padding: 0 1.5rem;
            }
            
            .case-hero {
                padding: 4rem 0 3rem;
            }
            
            .section-content {
                padding: 2rem;
            }
            
            .growth-viz {
                padding: 2rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
  </Fragment>

  <!-- Header -->
    <header class="header">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header-content">
                <a href="/" class="back-link">
                    ← Back to Portfolio
                </a>
                <button class="theme-toggle" id="themeToggle" type="button" data-theme-toggle aria-label="Toggle theme">
                    <span id="themeIcon" data-theme-icon aria-hidden="true">☀️</span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="case-hero">
        <div class="container narrow">
            <h1>Founding & Scaling the AI Platform Design Organization</h1>
            <p class="case-subtitle">Building the system that builds the product</p>
            
            <div class="case-meta">
                <div class="meta-item">
                    <span class="meta-label">Company</span>
                    <span class="meta-value">ServiceNow</span>
                </div>
                <div class="meta-item">
                    <span class="meta-label">Timeline</span>
                    <span class="meta-value">Oct 2022 – Mar 2025</span>
                </div>
                <div class="meta-item">
                    <span class="meta-label">Role</span>
                    <span class="meta-value">Sr. Manager, AI Product Design</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="impact-badges">
                <span class="impact-badge">4× Team Growth</span>
                <span class="impact-badge">88% Employee Engagement</span>
                <span class="impact-badge">200M+ AI Assists</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="content">
        <div class="container narrow">
            
            <!-- Context -->
            <div class="section">
                <div class="section-content">
                    <h4>Context & Stakes</h4>
                    <p>ServiceNow's AI ambition accelerated rapidly with generative and agentic AI, but design ownership, decision rights, and operating models were fragmented. Without a clear platform design function, teams risked shipping inconsistent, untrusted AI experiences that would stall adoption and erode confidence.</p>
                    <p><strong>If this failed:</strong> AI would scale faster than trust, turning innovation into fragmentation and slowing adoption at the moment it mattered most.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- The Real Problem -->
            <div class="section">
                <div class="section-content">
                    <h4>The Real Problem</h4>
                    <p>The challenge was not hiring designers or shipping features. It was the absence of a durable system that could translate AI ambition into repeatable, high-quality outcomes across products, teams, and time.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Vision & Strategy -->
            <div class="section">
                <div class="section-content">
                    <h4>Vision & North Star</h4>
                    <p>I believed clarity and humanity were competitive advantages. If we could give teams shared direction, strong principles, and psychological safety, we could move faster and ship AI responsibly without slowing innovation.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="section">
                <div class="section-content">
                    <h4>Strategy & Approach</h4>
                    <p>Founded a centralized AI Platform Design organization with clear mandate and scope. Designed the org around leverage: frameworks, patterns, governance, and enablement. Invested early in leadership roles and cross-functional trust, not just execution capacity. Explicitly deprioritized bespoke design work in favor of scalable systems.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Team Photos -->
            <div class="images-section">
                <h3>Building the Team</h3>
                <div class="images-grid">
                    <div class="image-wrapper image-full">
                        <img src="/2026/team-group-dinner.jpg" alt="AI Platform Design Team Gathering">
                        <p class="image-caption">AI Platform Design team gathering — growing from 15 to 62 people</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="image-wrapper">
                        <img src="/2026/workshop-teamcharter.jpeg" alt="Design Workshop" style="height: 280px; object-fit: cover;">
                        <p class="image-caption">Collaborative workshop session</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="image-wrapper">
                        <img src="/2026/team-cookingclass.jpeg" alt="Team Collaboration" style="height: 280px; object-fit: cover;">
                        <p class="image-caption">Team building and collaboration</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Growth Visualization -->
            <div class="growth-viz">
                <div class="viz-header">
                    <h3>Organization Growth</h3>
                    <span class="viz-badge">4× Scale</span>
                </div>
                <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 3rem;">Oct 2022 – Mar 2025 • 29 months</p>
                
                <div class="phases-grid">
                    <div class="growth-arrow"></div>
                    
                    <div class="phase">
                        <div class="phase-number">15</div>
                        <div class="phase-label">Foundation</div>
                        <div class="phase-date">Oct 2022</div>
                        <div class="dots-grid">
                            <div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="phase">
                        <div class="phase-number">28</div>
                        <div class="phase-label">Rapid Scale</div>
                        <div class="phase-date">Apr 2023</div>
                        <div class="dots-grid">
                            <div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="phase">
                        <div class="phase-number">45</div>
                        <div class="phase-label">Expansion</div>
                        <div class="phase-date">Oct 2023</div>
                        <div class="dots-grid">
                            <div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="phase">
                        <div class="phase-number">62</div>
                        <div class="phase-label">Maturity</div>
                        <div class="phase-date">Mar 2025</div>
                        <div class="dots-grid">
                            <div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="viz-divider"></div>
                
                <div class="stats-grid">
                    <div class="stat">
                        <div class="stat-value">88%</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Employee Engagement</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat">
                        <div class="stat-value">6</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Leadership Roles Added</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat">
                        <div class="stat-value">20+</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Product Areas Supported</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- What I Shipped -->
            <div class="section">
                <div class="section-content">
                    <h4>What I Shipped</h4>
                    <p>Built and scaled the AI Platform Design org 4× over two years, with rapid initial scale in the first six months by borrowing five top designers from partner teams to augment a core team of six. Established platform-wide AI experience ownership. Shipped shared AI frameworks, patterns, and governance models that evolved rapidly as the technology changed and we learned in real time.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Outcomes & Impact -->
            <div class="section">
                <div class="section-content">
                    <h4>Outcomes & Impact</h4>
                    <div class="outcomes-grid">
                        <div class="outcome-card">
                            <span class="outcome-value">4×</span>
                            <div class="outcome-label">Team scale in 2 years</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="outcome-card">
                            <span class="outcome-value">88%</span>
                            <div class="outcome-label">Engagement during change</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="outcome-card">
                            <span class="outcome-value">200M+</span>
                            <div class="outcome-label">AI assists powered</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
